# Backend conventions

- CommonJS (`require` / `module.exports`); Express routers in `backend/routes/`.
- Models in `backend/models/`; shared helpers in `backend/utils/` and `backend/config/`.
- Mount paths in `server.js`: `/candidate`, `/recruiter`, `/company`, `/team`, `/job`, `/workflow`, `/dashboard`.
- Interview AI endpoints live on the app root: `POST /ask`, `POST /evaluate` (use `askGroq`).
- Auth: `bcryptjs` + `jsonwebtoken`; read Bearer tokens where helpers like `getTokenFromRequest` already exist.
- Email: extend `backend/utils/emailService.js` / `backend/config/mail.js` — do not add a second mail stack.
- Uploads: Multer disk storage under `backend/uploads`; PDF parsing via `pdf-parse`.
- Prefer adding logic to existing route/controller files over new parallel modules unless the feature is clearly separate.
- Return JSON error shapes consistent with nearby handlers (`res.status(...).json({ ... })`).
